SUMMARY:Pilot test of the digital culture interview: A novel method for assessing the digital habits of youth receiving mental health care
LOCATION:Amphitheatre\, 4333 Côte-Ste-Catherine Rd.\, Montreal QC H3T 1E4
CATEGORIES:Psychosocial Research Rounds
DESCRIPTION:Psychosocial Research Rounds\n\nTOPIC: Pilot test of the digital culture interview: A novel method for assessing the digital habits of youth receiving mental health care\n\nSPEAKER: Anis Boukhari\n\nLEARNING OBJECTIVES:\n• Reflect on the importance of addressing digital culture in mental health clinical practice.\n• Understand the role of the Digital Culture Interview in exploring patients’ digital practices in mental health care.\n• Describe clinicians’ and patients’ perceptions of the utility\, feasibility and acceptability of the Digital Culture Interview.\n\nMEETING LINK: https://us06web.zoom.us/j/88488947071?pwd=SfbahYa0VEe7nCL2Hbc1aA6bXzfZeR.1\n\nORGANIZER: Vincent Paquin
